## Parallel fan-out (one turn, multiple Task calls)

| Workflow | `subagent_type` set |
| --- | --- |
| `/brainstorm` research | `codebase-review-agent` |
| `/plan` external research | `official-docs-research-agent`, `best-practices-research-agent` |
| `/plan` flow analysis | `user-flow-analysis-agent` |
| `/plan` embedded review | `code-simplicity-review-agent`, `vgv-review-agent`, `plan-splitting-agent` |
| `/plan-technical-review` | same three as plan review |
| `/build` Phase 3 | all five reviewers (see table above) |
| `/code-review` | vgv, architecture, test-quality, simplicity (+ pr-readiness if shipping) |
| `/hotfix` review | `vgv-review-agent`, `test-quality-review-agent` |
| Flutter diff pass | `flutter-reviewer` (after Dart changes) |

Launch parallel Tasks in **one assistant turn** when the skill says
**in parallel**. Do not serialize.

