## Tool scoping

- `flutter-reviewer` has `readonly: true` — no file edits
- Other reviewers must write raw reports under `docs/reviews/raw/`
- Never pass `readonly` as a Task argument (agent-file field only)

## Anti-patterns

- Narrating "I'll invoke the vgv-review-agent" without a Task call
- Wrong type strings (`vgv-review`, `VGVReviewAgent`, `@vgv-review-agent`)
- Sequential Phase 3 reviews when skill says parallel
- Relative `docs/reviews/raw` without `$PWD` prefix in subagent prompt
- Falling back to `generalPurpose` before install + Cursor restart

